From 2fce88c4e629a9bae6ce400732a60d723a2ae973 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: opencode-hh <opencode@local>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 08:16:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] runtime: trazas de eventos [EV] para confirmar el fix del
 deadlock

- events.cpp: traza en osSetEventMesg (event, mq, msg) y en el disparo VI
  (fire mq / fire pero mq=NULLPTR). Confirma que osSetEventMesg no se llama
  y que la VI produce retraces con mq=NULLPTR -> falta mapear osSetEventMesg.
---
 ultramodern/src/events.cpp    | 4 ++++
 ultramodern/src/mesgqueue.cpp | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/ultramodern/src/events.cpp b/ultramodern/src/events.cpp
index 17d7a47..bb1252e 100644
--- a/ultramodern/src/events.cpp
+++ b/ultramodern/src/events.cpp
@@ -148,6 +148,7 @@ ultramodern::renderer::ViRegs* ultramodern::renderer::get_vi_regs() {
 
